  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 180°C (356°F).",
    "Toss the beef strips with olive oil, minced garlic, paprika, cumin, red pepper flakes, lime zest, salt, and pepper until evenly coated.",
    "Place the seasoned beef in the center of a parchment paper square, fold the paper over, and seal the edges tightly to create a papillote.",
    "Bake the papillote in the preheated oven for 20 minutes until the beef reaches an internal temperature of 63°C (145°F).",
    "Remove the parchment, let the beef rest for 5 minutes, then unwrap and transfer the strips onto a warmed tortilla.",
    "Fold the tortilla around the beef, roll tightly, and serve immediately."
  ],
